’s prompt tokens pertain to few-shot examples.","image_text":["(b)","Qwen3","8B.","Comparing","Scores","vs","Prompt","Size","(Qwen3","8B)","MIPROv2","Abl:SelectBestCandidate","GEPA","GEPA+Merge","MIPROv2","GEPA+Merge","Abl:SelectBestCandidate","GEPA","or","e","e","Sc","eg","at","Ag","gr","61","60","59","58","57","56","55","2000","3000","4000","5000","6000","Aggregate","Prompt","Token","Count","(Cost","Proxy)","(a)","GPT-4.1","Mini.","Comparing","Scores","vs","Prompt","Size","(GPT-4.1","Mini)","MIPROv2","Abl:SelectBestCandidate","GEPA","GEPA+Merge","MIPROv2","GEPA+Merge","Abl:SelectBestCandidate","GEPA","or","e","e","Sc","eg","at","Ag","gr","68","66","64","62","60","2000","3000","4000","5000","6000","7000","Aggregate","Prompt","Token","Count","(Cost","Proxy)"],"render_dpi":150,"asset_path":"figures/fig_2507.19457-Figure17-1-631572aa6145.png","asset_sha256":"631572aa6145901bdd02851cd6b0dc33c0c37da51aa1f9b08a288603db537c4c","metadata_sha256":"355ec187af6f88a0d379fd6ca9372e605fd93886c4253e40d6fcc1efc46f432c"},{"artifact_id":"Figure18","kind":"figure","detector_name":"pdffigures2","detector_fingerprint":"pdffigures2-0.0.12-SNAPSHOT","source_pdf_sha256":"ab3a5139bac83f192ad67529368d77b84b0d807e95a8e4fd0daa8d45fd046bec","page_index":30,"region":{"x1":96.48,"y1":111.84,"x2":518.4,"y2":426.24},"caption_region":{"x1":140.6959991455078,"y1":439.2795104980469,"x2":471.3048400878906,"y2":445.281982421875},"caption":"Figure 18: Comparing the token counts of optimized programs across benchmarks.","image_text":["(b)","Comparing","the","token","counts","of","the","optimized","programs","across","benchmarks","for","Qwen3","8B.","Optimized","Prompt","Size","across","optimizers","(lower","is","better),","Qwen3","8B","MIPROv2","GEPA","GEPA+Merge","9.2x","lower","2.8x","lower","8.0x","lower","3.8x","lower","3.7x","lower","6.0x","lower4.5x","lower","6.4x","lower","4.7x","lower","4.9x","lower","7275.0","5252.0","2438.0","10071.0","6259.0","ns",")","to","ke","(i","n","iz","e","pt","S","Pr",